To transform NarcotiX Systems into a structured, journey-based experience with unlockable
  content, you need to move from a "Sandbox" architecture (where everything is available
  immediately) to a "Gated Progression" architecture.

  Here is a detailed architectural and gameplay plan to achieve this.

  ---

  1. Architectural Changes

  A. The MissionManifest (Data-Driven Design)
  Instead of hardcoding quests in questManager.js, create a structured data file (JSON or JS
  Object) that defines the entire campaign tree. This makes it easy to add 50+ missions without
  cluttering logic code.

  Proposed Structure (`game/data/campaign.js`):

